 "description": "NXP Semiconductors offers JCOP, a secure Java Card Operating System based on several independent 3rd party specifications, such as Java Card 3.0.4 specifications, the GlobalPlatform card specifications 2.2.1 and few International Organization for Standards (like ISO7816), EMV (Europay, MasterCard and VISA) and others. By adhering to these standards JCOP 3 SECID P60 ensures large interoperability with third-party applets providers, card issuers as well as all existing Smart Card infrastructures.",
